msgstr "Pkuru.com 官方競技雙打排名。"

#: src/components/pages/LeagueRankingsPage.re.mjs:209
msgid ""
"The top 8 men and top 8 women qualify — each bracket is drafted into 4 "
"doubles teams for the finals. Prize pool includes 2 x Ella Oh Pink V2 "
"widebody paddles, 2 x RPM Friction Pro V2 14mm paddles, and 1 x RPM Friction "
"Pro V2 16mm paddle. The winning pair for mens and womens doubles receive the "
"prize, along with 1 bonus category to be decided for the 5th winner. Only "
"players who are physically in Japan to receive the prizes are eligible to "
"win. Any *Rated* event on Pkuru.com can submit rated matches that can "
"qualify you for the top 8 draft. We reserve the right to disqualify players, "
"matches, or clubs that are suspected of cheating at our own independent "
"discretion and without notice. There is no cost to participation and "
"Pkuru.com does not collect any fee from organizers participating in the "
"Playoff Draft."
msgstr ""
"男子前8名及女子前8名晉級決賽——每個組別透過選秀分成4支雙打隊伍角逐總決賽。獎品"
"包括2支Ella Oh Pink V2寬體球拍、2支RPM Friction Pro V2 14mm球拍及1支RPM "
"Friction Pro V2 16mm球拍。男子雙打及女子雙打的冠軍組合將各獲得獎品，另設1個額"
"外獎項類別留待第5位得獎者決定。僅限實際身處日本的球員方可領取獎品。在"
"Pkuru.com上任何標示為「已評級」的賽事均可提交評級賽果，以爭取晉身前8名選秀資"
"格。我們保留根據自身獨立判斷、無需事先通知而取消任何涉嫌作弊球員、賽事或俱樂"
"部資格的權利。參賽無需費用，Pkuru.com亦不向參與季後賽選秀的主辦方收取任何費"
"用。"

